Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(desktop):=20=E2=8C=98N=20starts=20the=20ne?=
 =?UTF-8?q?w=20chat=20on=20This=20device,=20=E2=8C=98=E2=87=A7N=20keeps=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?the=20selected=20gateway=20[daveey]?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

⌘N (session.new) now switches the active gateway to the local connection
when another source is selected (skipped if the local runtime is not
installed). New session.newSameGateway (⌘⇧N) is the old ⌘N behaviour.
session.rename moves from ⌘⇧N to ⌘⇧E.
---
